ribed it as it was like  torture it was so tight and delicate we  wouldn't be surprised to find out if  she'd been having dizzy spells on set  would you dare step into a dress that  compresses your every organ number 12  Rafe finds hated his Voldemort costume  in Harry Potter because everyone would  walk up to him and say got your nose he  was just getting sick of it kidding but  he was relieved to finally get the  costume off one reason was the tights he  had to wear kept falling and they were  irritating him Rafe joked sometimes when  the stunt team are getting too Macho I  would tease them with my inner thigh  number 13. diamonds aren't a girl's best  friend Carrie Mulligan for the great Gat  to be admitted it was a little bit of a  relief stick of the diamond I felt sort  of a waste of responsibility wearing  them the Tiffany and Company diamonds  were worth so many millions that she had  to be shadowed by a security guard they  were created specifically for the  character too she said there'd be  diamond bracelets on each arm and  diamond earrings and rings and strings  of pearls around my neck and I could see  this guy in the corner watching me  intently in case I ran off with anything  she did end up breaking the String of  Pearls she wore a few times so the only  thing she's guilty of is breaking the  property not stealing it number 14 when  you find out how Jayla went to the  bathroom the whole thing kind of loses  its Mystique poor Jennifer Lawrence was  practically nude in her X-Men costume  something she was definitely not a fan  of but going to the bathroom was next  level in all that blue makeup she had to  use a funnel so as to not leave the  toilet seat blue or herself needing  touch-ups Rebecca Romaine had quite the  experience too saying one time director  Brian Singer opened the tent where I was  literally bent over a chair getting my  crack touched up and I was like don't  come in here Brian you don't need to see  this and he said you really need